{"entry_id":"entry:r21:40112011:0055","category":"character_story","context_group":"character_story:40112011","subtype":"character_story_regular_style_pair","source_text":"「きみはわからないのか！？\\n　サンソヴィーノ嬢の小さな身体から醸し出されるエロスの塊が！\\n　あのいたいけな、初心な肉体に内包された肉の曲線美が！」","source_locale":"ja","observed_translation_ko":"너는 모르는거냐!?\n산소비노 양의 작은 몸에서 자아내는 에로스 덩어리가!\n그 애처로운, 초심의 육체에 내포된 살의 곡선미가!","translation":null,"status":"reviewing","confidence":"high","identity":{"novel_id":"40112011","raw_index":55,"is_title":false},"speaker":{"jp":"ブグロー","ko_observed":"부그로"},"finding_ids":["R21-M001"],"review_status":"REVIEWED_PROPOSAL_FIRST_PASS","semantic_review_stage":"R21_RESTORED_FIRST_PASS","publish_ready":false,"runtime_verified":false,"evidence_id":"ev:r21:40112011:0055"}
{"entry_id":"entry:r21:40112011:0056","category":"character_story","context_group":"character_story:40112011","subtype":"character_story_regular_style_pair","source_text":"「はぁ……はぁ…………！\\n　あの毛すら生えていない細い足の感触……どんなだろうか……！\\n　いや、むしろ触った時の反応の方が興奮する……！」","source_locale":"ja","observed_translation_ko":"하아...... 하아............!\n저 털조차 나지 않은 가는 다리의 감촉...... 어떠할까......!\n아니, 오히려 만졌을 때의 반응 쪽이 흥분돼......!","translation":null,"status":"reviewing","confidence":"high","identity":{"novel_id":"40112011","raw_index":56,"is_title":false},"speaker":{"jp":"ブグロー","ko_observed":"부그로"},"finding_ids":[],"review_status":"REVIEWED_NO_CHANGE_FIRST_PASS","semantic_review_stage":"R21_RESTORED_FIRST_PASS","publish_ready":false,"runtime_verified":false,"evidence_id":"ev:r21:40112011:0056"}
{"entry_id":"entry:r21:40112011:0057","category":"character_story","context_group":"character_story:40112011","subtype":"character_story_regular_style_pair","source_text":"「彼女のスカートをチラリとめくった時の、赤い頬……！\\n　ちょっと頬を膨らませて、恥ずかしがりながらわたしを叱る……！\\n　た、たまらないシチュ……さ、最高っ……！」","source_locale":"ja","observed_translation_ko":"그녀의 스커트를 살짝 들췄을 때의, 붉어진 뺨......!\n볼을 조금 부풀리고, 부끄러워 하면서 나를 꾸짖는......!\n차, 참을 수 없는 시추...... 최, 최곳......!","translation":null,"status":"reviewing","confidence":"high","identity":{"novel_id":"40112011","raw_index":57,"is_title":false},"speaker":{"jp":"ブグロー","ko_observed":"부그로"},"finding_ids":["R21-M002"],"review_status":"REVIEWED_PROPOSAL_FIRST_PASS","semantic_review_stage":"R21_RESTORED_FIRST_PASS","publish_ready":false,"runtime_verified":false,"evidence_id":"ev:r21:40112011:0057"}
{"entry_id":"entry:r21:40112012:0031","category":"character_story","context_group":"character_story:40112012","subtype":"character_story_regular_style_pair","source_text":"「想像してみてよ……！　サンソヴィーノ嬢がこれを着てるとこ！\\n　はぁ……はぁ……清楚な服の内側に見える、淫らな本性……！\\n　た、たまらないぃぃ……！」","source_locale":"ja","observed_translation_ko":"상상해보라고......! 산소비노 양이 이걸 입고있는 것을!\n하아...... 하아...... 청초한 옷 안쪽으로 보이는, 음란한 본성......!\n차, 참을 수 없어어어......!","translation":null,"status":"reviewing","confidence":"high","identity":{"novel_id":"40112012","raw_index":31,"is_title":false},"speaker":{"jp":"ブグロー","ko_observed":"부그로"},"finding_ids":[],"review_status":"REVIEWED_NO_CHANGE_FIRST_PASS","semantic_review_stage":"R21_RESTORED_FIRST_PASS","publish_ready":false,"runtime_verified":false,"evidence_id":"ev:r21:40112012:0031"}
{"entry_id":"entry:r21:40112021:0016","category":"character_story","context_group":"character_story:40112021","subtype":"character_story_regular_style_pair","source_text":"「おおお……！　あの可愛らしい少女……お客さんか！？\\n　あの赤いワンピース、肩が露出していて……いい……！」","source_locale":"ja","observed_translation_ko":"오오오......! 저 귀여운 소녀...... 손님인가!?\n저 붉은 원피스, 어깨가 노출되어 있어서...... 좋아......!","translation":null,"status":"reviewing","confidence":"high","identity":{"novel_id":"40112021","raw_index":16,"is_title":false},"speaker":{"jp":"ブグロー","ko_observed":"부그로"},"finding_ids":[],"review_status":"REVIEWED_NO_CHANGE_FIRST_PASS","semantic_review_stage":"R21_RESTORED_FIRST_PASS","publish_ready":false,"runtime_verified":false,"evidence_id":"ev:r21:40112021:0016"}
{"entry_id":"entry:r21:40112021:0017","category":"character_story","context_group":"character_story:40112021","subtype":"character_story_regular_style_pair","source_text":"「真っ白な肌と赤い布地のバランスがとてもえっちだ……！\\n　も、もう少し近くで見ていいかな……いいよね……！？\\n　はぁ……はぁ…………！」","source_locale":"ja","observed_translation_ko":"새하얀 피부와 붉은 옷감의 밸런스가 상당히 야해......!\n조, 좀 더 가까이서 봐도 괜찮을까...... 괜찮지......!?\n하아...... 하아............!","translation":null,"status":"reviewing","confidence":"high","identity":{"novel_id":"40112021","raw_index":17,"is_title":false},"speaker":{"jp":"ブグロー","ko_observed":"부그로"},"finding_ids":[],"review_status":"REVIEWED_NO_CHANGE_FIRST_PASS","semantic_review_stage":"R21_RESTORED_FIRST_PASS","publish_ready":false,"runtime_verified":false,"evidence_id":"ev:r21:40112021:0017"}
{"entry_id":"entry:r21:40112021:0018","category":"character_story","context_group":"character_story:40112021","subtype":"character_story_regular_style_pair","source_text":"「おっと、ヨダレが……！\\n　いや、違う、違うぞ館長、これは純粋な芸術的好奇心でね。\\n　しかし、あの少女……か、描きたい……はぁぁぁぁぁぁっ！」","source_locale":"ja","observed_translation_ko":"이런, 침이......!\n아니, 아니야, 아니라고 관장, 이건 순수한 예술적 호기심으로 말이지.\n그런데, 저 소녀...... 그, 그리고 싶어...... 하아아아아아앗!","translation":null,"status":"reviewing","confidence":"high","identity":{"novel_id":"40112021","raw_index":18,"is_title":false},"speaker":{"jp":"ブグロー","ko_observed":"부그로"},"finding_ids":[],"review_status":"REVIEWED_NO_CHANGE_FIRST_PASS","semantic_review_stage":"R21_RESTORED_FIRST_PASS","publish_ready":false,"runtime_verified":false,"evidence_id":"ev:r21:40112021:0018"}
{"entry_id":"entry:r21:40112032:0062","category":"character_story","context_group":"character_story:40112032","subtype":"character_story_regular_style_pair","source_text":"「はぁ……はぁ……なんてかわいい女の子なの……！\\n　私もこんな子になって、男を誘惑してみたい……！\\n　ブグロー先生なら知ってるかしら……！？」","source_locale":"ja","observed_translation_ko":"하아...... 하아...... 어쩜 이렇게 귀여운 여자아이일까......!\n나도 이런 아이가 되어서, 남자를 유혹하고 싶어......!\n부그로 선생님이라면 알고계실까......!?","translation":null,"status":"reviewing","confidence":"high","identity":{"novel_id":"40112032","raw_index":62,"is_title":false},"speaker":{"jp":"客の女","ko_observed":"여자 손님"},"finding_ids":[],"review_status":"REVIEWED_NO_CHANGE_FIRST_PASS","semantic_review_stage":"R21_RESTORED_FIRST_PASS","publish_ready":false,"runtime_verified":false,"evidence_id":"ev:r21:40112032:0062"}
{"entry_id":"entry:r21:40112051:0054","category":"character_story","context_group":"character_story:40112051","subtype":"character_story_regular_style_pair","source_text":"「ふぅむ、このパンツは初めて見る……イマージュのものかな？\\n　あどけなさが残る印象……ネイト、あるいはカティか？\\n　意外とツァオがこういうのを穿いている可能性も……」","source_locale":"ja","observed_translation_ko":"흐으음, 이 팬티는 처음 보네...... 이마쥬 것이려나?\n순진함이 남아 있는 인상...... 네이트, 아니면 카티인가?\n의외로 차오가 이런걸 입을 가능성도......","translation":null,"status":"reviewing","confidence":"high","identity":{"novel_id":"40112051","raw_index":54,"is_title":false},"speaker":{"jp":"ブグロー","ko_observed":"부그로"},"finding_ids":[],"review_status":"REVIEWED_NO_CHANGE_FIRST_PASS","semantic_review_stage":"R21_RESTORED_FIRST_PASS","publish_ready":false,"runtime_verified":false,"evidence_id":"ev:r21:40112051:0054"}
{"entry_id":"entry:r21:40112052:0007","category":"character_story","context_group":"character_story:40112052","subtype":"character_story_regular_style_pair","source_text":"「なにより、恥じらう女の子はたまらなくえっちだよ！\\n　そう、やはり羞恥心があってこそエロスを感じられる。\\n　はぁぁ、またあんな顔で叱られてみたい……」","source_locale":"ja","observed_translation_ko":"무엇보다, 부끄러워하는 여자아이는 참을 수 없을 만큼 야하다고!\n그래, 역시 수치심이 있어야만 에로스를 느낄 수 있지.\n하아아, 또 그런 얼굴로 혼나보고 싶어......","translation":null,"status":"reviewing","confidence":"high","identity":{"novel_id":"40112052","raw_index":7,"is_title":false},"speaker":{"jp":"ブグロー","ko_observed":"부그로"},"finding_ids":[],"review_status":"REVIEWED_NO_CHANGE_FIRST_PASS","semantic_review_stage":"R21_RESTORED_FIRST_PASS","publish_ready":false,"runtime_verified":false,"evidence_id":"ev:r21:40112052:0007"}
